{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33751","headline":"七爱诗 李翰林 · 皮日休","name":"七爱诗 李翰林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱李太白，身是酒星魄。\n口吐天上文，迹作人间客。\n磥砢千丈林，澄澈万寻碧。\n醉中草乐府，十幅笔一息。\n召见承明庐，天子亲赐食。\n醉曾吐御牀，傲几触天泽。\n权臣妬逸才，心如斗筲窄。\n失恩出内署，海岳甘自适。\n刺谒戴接㒿，赴宴着縠屐。\n诸侯百步迎，明君九天忆。\n竟遭腐胁疾，醉魄归八极。\n大鹏不可笼，大椿不可植。\n蓬壶不可见，姑射不可识。\n五岳爲辞锋，四溟作胸臆。\n惜哉千万年，此俊不可得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}